{"description":"Join our in-person Toronto Physical AI Workshop and Meetup, co-presented by Nebius and Voxel51, hosted at the Terrace Room, University of Toronto.\nA laptop is required to participate in the hands-on workshop - please bring one. Space is limited, so register early.\nA company, university, or government email address is required to take part in the hands-on workshop. Personal and disposable email accounts (Gmail, Yahoo, Outlook, and similar) cannot be used for the workshop environment. This is a blanket policy of the workshop platform to prevent fraud and abuse and to meet compliance requirements. If you need an exception, contact the hosts before the event.\nBy submitting, you agree to Voxel51's Terms of Service and Privacy Policy and agree to receive occasional emails.","organizer":"Voxel51 Events"}